#######################################################
##                                                   ##
## README File for generation of file 7 for Si in SiC##
## using LEAPR module of NJOY processing package.    ##
## Included content is for the generation of the     ##
## inelastic part of the S(a,b) published in         ##
## ENDF/B-VIII.beta5. The coherent elastic xsec      ##
## (MT = 2) was generated using an 'in-house'        ##
## routine [1].                                      ##
##                                                   ##
## Compare to beta4 release, the coherent elastic    ##
## xsec is updated. The alpha, beta grid for S(a,b)  ##
## is updated.                                       ##
##                                                   ##
##  1. Y. Zhu, A.I. Hawari, "Implementation of a     ##
##     Generalized Coherent Elastic Scattering       ##
##     Formulation for Thermal Neutron Scattering    ##
##     Analysis," Proceedings of ICNC 2015: 35th     ##
##     International Conference on Nuclear           ##
##     Criticality Safety (2015)                     ##
##                                                   ##
#######################################################
##                                                   ##
## LEIP Laboratories (Sep 17 2017)                   ##
##                                                   ##
#######################################################

NOTES:
1) The published ENDF-BVIII library tabulates the
   coherent elastic cross section on MT = 2; therefore,
   the provided leapr input may reproduce MT = 4 only!
	
Folder Content
--------------
tsl-SiinSiC.endf = File 7 in ENDF-6 format
         submitted to CSWEG for publication in
         ENDF/B-VIII (MT = 2, MT = 4)


File 7 Library Parameters
-------------------------
iMAT = 43
ZA = 143
Temperatures = 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800, 1000, 1200 K

NJOY Compilation
----------------
The NJOY99 package used in the processing of these
libraries was compiled with ifort from the intel-2017 
composer suite. The upn was version 396.
